## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
## nexus | ItacaChamber.tl208.init.mac
##
## Template. The job script replaces @CONFIG@ with the configuration macro of the job.
## Written by scripts/background/write_background_macros.jl from the cards of config/background
## (variant IE_L1500_ICS20). Do not edit: change the cards and write it again.
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

/control/execute macros/physics/DefaultPhysicsList.mac

/nexus/RegisterGeometry ItacaChamber
/nexus/RegisterGenerator IonGenerator

/nexus/RegisterPersistencyManager PersistencyManager

/nexus/RegisterRunAction DefaultRunAction
/nexus/RegisterEventAction DefaultEventAction
/nexus/RegisterTrackingAction DefaultTrackingAction

/nexus/RegisterMacro @CONFIG@
/nexus/RegisterDelayedMacro macros/background/IE_L1500_ICS20/ItacaChamber.tl208.decay.mac
